# Two @schema kinds whose accessor namespaces coincide (foo_bar and fooBar
# are both ir.FooBar) are reported at the second kind.
# error: view_name_clash.grammar:17:5:
# error: both map to the accessor namespace ir.FooBar
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser

@schema
    foo_bar   a:leaf
    fooBar    b:leaf

top! = IDENT                                → (foo_bar 1)
     | IDENT IDENT                          → (fooBar 2)  ~ "the first name is a comment"
